  "description": "YITAMOTOR floor mats are made with non-toxic and odorless TPE material, ensuring 100% safety even in extremely hot weather. Using 3D laser scanning technology gives the fullest protection to both the front and back.\nFitment\n2017-2025 Mazda CX-5\nDoes not fit vehicles with vinyl flooring,only for carpet flooring.\nFor your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.\nFeatures\nHigh-density TPE material\nMade with non-toxic and odorless TPE material, ensuring 100% safety even in extreme weather. Contains no latex, cadmium, lead, or any harmful PVCs.\nAdvanced 3D laser technology\nOffers a Precise fit to your vehicle floor, ensuring a finished product that hugs the contours of the floor. No cutting, no trimming.\nSpecially designed channels & raised edge\nEnsure the liner can effectively trap the liquid, snow, or sand to keep your car and shoes clean and effectively protect your vehicle from all kinds of messes.\nLiner secured in place\nThe raised nib on the bottom provides maximum retention and secures the liner in place. Non-skid nib backing helps hold mats firmly in place. Specially designed fully adapt to vehicles for a secure fit.",
